# Goal
float64 speed               # Downward speed (m/s)
float64 effort_threshold    # Contact threshold on joint_3 (Nm)
---
# Result
float64 contact_depth       # Depth travelled before contact (m)
bool success                # True if contact detected
string message              # Status or failure reason
---
# Feedback
float64 current_effort      # Real‐time joint_3 effort reading (Nm)
float64 current_depth       # Real‐time travelled depth (m)